title "Reaction energy profile"
layout layered dir=down
page a1
font 6pt..36pt wrap=17em

style state color=#1565C0
style barrier color=#C62828
style result color=#2E7D32

node reactants "Reactants" .state
| starting chemical energy
| particles must collide to react
node collision "Effective collision" .barrier
| correct orientation and enough energy
| collision frequency depends on concentration
node transition "Transition state" .barrier
| highest-energy configuration
| old bonds weaken as new bonds form
node activation "Activation energy" .barrier
| Ea = H(transition) - H(reactants)
| controls the temperature dependence of rate
node products "Products" .result
| new bonds and new energy
| composition is conserved, arrangement changes
node delta "Reaction enthalpy" .result
| delta H = H(products) - H(reactants)
| exothermic if delta H < 0
node rate "Reaction rate" .result
| concentration change per unit time
| rate law is determined experimentally
node catalyst "Catalyst" .result
| alternate pathway with lower activation energy
| regenerated; does not change delta H
node equilibrium "Equilibrium" .result
| forward and reverse rates are equal
| concentrations need not be equal
node lechatelier "Le Chatelier principle" .result
| perturbation shifts a dynamic equilibrium
| temperature changes both rate and equilibrium
node conservation "Conservation checks" .result
| atoms and charge balance on both sides
| energy is transferred, not destroyed
node mechanism "Reaction mechanism" .result
| elementary steps explain the observed rate law
| slow step can limit the overall rate

reactants -> collision
collision -> transition
transition -> products
reactants -> activation
activation -> transition
transition -> delta
collision -> rate
rate -> mechanism
products -> equilibrium
catalyst -> rate
equilibrium -> lechatelier
reactants ..> conservation "balance"
products ..> conservation "balance"
catalyst ..> transition "lowers barrier"

prefer reactants at top weight=3
prefer products at bottom weight=3
prefer catalyst near activation within=18em weight=3
prefer equilibrium near lechatelier within=18em weight=2
